<h1>Mobile Application</h1>
<p>Lolo App</p>
<p>Lolo app is a geospatial rock climbing guidebook application designed to inform users locations and attributes of rock climbs in the Lolo Pass Area. My role in the development of this application was curating rock climbing data and setting up a PostgreSQL database that consists of several relational tables to organize routes spatially and by specific attributes. </p>


